 Athenian philosopher Socrates was sentenced to death", "conf": 0.928, "box": [[125, 722], [934, 718], [934, 751], [125, 755]]}, {"text": "GreekCity-States", "conf": 0.91, "box": [[88, 827], [303, 825], [303, 855], [89, 857]]}, {"text": "Ancient Greece was made up of numerous small city-states, each with its own dialect,", "conf": 0.938, "box": [[91, 872], [1165, 866], [1166, 899], [92, 905]]}, {"text": "cultureand identity.There wereabout 150 city-states in Greece surroundedbyfarmlands.", "conf": 0.921, "box": [[91, 909], [1164, 904], [1165, 934], [91, 939]]}, {"text": "Cities were situated inthevalleyseitherbetween mountains or on narrow coastal plains.", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[92, 946], [1163, 942], [1164, 969], [92, 973]]}, {"text": "These“city-states\"wereindependentof one anotherwiththeirown government.", "conf": 0.885, "box": [[91, 981], [1074, 977], [1074, 1005], [91, 1009]]}, {"text": "GreekPoliticalStructure", "conf": 0.874, "box": [[91, 1056], [387, 1056], [387, 1082], [91, 1082]]}, {"text": "Thethreemostcommonsystemsofgovernment in", "conf": 0.925, "box": [[88, 1099], [699, 1096], [700, 1125], [89, 1128]]}, {"text": "ancientGreekwereasfollows:", "conf": 0.925, "box": [[89, 1136], [454, 1134], [454, 1161], [90, 1163]]}, {"text": "Democracy:", "conf": 0.871, "box": [[85, 1222], [236, 1225], [235, 1254], [84, 1252]]}, {"text": "Rulebypeople", "conf": 0.915, "box": [[312, 1221], [490, 1218], [490, 1252], [312, 1254]]}, {"text": "Monarchy:", "conf": 0.807, "box": [[86, 1266], [225, 1268], [224, 1299], [85, 1297]]}, {"text": "Rule by a king", "conf": 0.872, "box": [[314, 1266], [481, 1266], [481, 1299], [314, 1299]]}, {"text": "Aristocracy:", "conf": 0.891, "box": [[84, 1312], [236, 1314], [235, 1344], [83, 1342]]}, {"text": "Rulebyselectednoblesorrich", "conf": 0.92, "box": [[313, 1312], [672, 1309], [673, 1339], [313, 1342]]}, {"text": "people", "conf": 0.784, "box": [[310, 1348], [398, 1344], [400, 1378], [311, 1382]]}, {"text": "GreekMonuments", "conf": 0